      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my left eye has this weird dark shadow like a curtain is falling over it. it's kinda trippy but i think i just need to wake up. i have like 3 cans of monster energy and some extra strength advil, do u think if i take all of that it'll clear my head and fix the vision so i can work my shift tomorrow? i rly cant deal with a doctor visit right now lol.",
